---
// The "& other stories" lockup as a sticky heading.
//
// Structure (see packages/stories-heading for the mechanics):
//   .sh__track  — reserves the pin duration in normal flow (its height is the
//                 scroll distance the heading stays pinned).
//     .sh__pin  — position:sticky; the lockup pins here at --sh-top.
//       .sh__stage — 12-col grid: ampersand (col 1) · "other stories" (cols 4–7).
//
// The ampersand parallaxes (bottom→top aligned) and the outline→solid font-swap
// wipes, both driven by one scroll progress over the pin duration.
//
// This component owns ONLY the lockup. The body copy + video carousel are the
// page's responsibility: they live in the content region that FLOWS BELOW this
// (see FullHeroLayout's .fh__content riser), which rises into the empty space the
// pinned lockup reserves and pushes it away.
//
// Face-swapping pieces render TWICE — an outline layer and a solid layer in the
// same cell — so the reveal clip can wipe one over the other.
---

<stories-heading>
	<div class="sh__track" data-sh-track>
		<div class="sh__pin" data-sh-pin>
			<div class="sh__stage" data-sh-stage>
				<div class="sh__amp" aria-hidden="true">
					<span class="sh__outline">&amp;</span>
					<span class="sh__solid">&amp;</span>
				</div>

				<h2 class="sh__heading">
					<span class="sh__outline" aria-hidden="true">other stories</span>
					<span class="sh__solid">other stories</span>
				</h2>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</stories-heading>
